# Allow-list: ignore everything, then track only code and docs.
# Data (sensors\, rust-logs\, crashes.csv, state.json, engine.log) must never be committed:
# Rust's logs contain the Steam ID, player name and server address.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!_engine/
_engine/*
!_engine/crashlog.ps1
!_engine/install-task.ps1
